# desk is AT 12. A clock accruing nothing still consumes a slot, so a dead entry blocks a live
# candidate on the only path from research to capital. The registry deliberately counts dormant
# clocks until an explicit ledgered retirement -- over-counting m only tightens the bar, the safe
# error -- but that trade is only correct if someone then fixes or retires the clock.
