# L1.28c defect underneath it -- an organ whose cadence was never DECIDED runs at zero forever.
# CEILING TYPE: INFORMATION-ARRIVAL. The payload is `git log --since=24.hours`, so a daily fire
# tiles the window exactly -- no gap, no overlap. Firing 2x/day against an unchanged 24h window
